  "evidenceBoundary": {
    "exact": "Selected native inputs authenticate the named methods and ordinary signatures, stored fields and enum identities, complete reviewed body windows, linked direct calls and branches, and arithmetic/return witnesses. These byte checks retain the reviewed interpretation; they do not discover new formulas.",
    "direct": "On the normally returning unpatched normal-entity path, takeAtkSnapshot is tested first. With that flag false, simpleCalculation true selects stored atkScale through GetValue and multiplies its Single result, converted to Double, by DamagePackData.attackerAttributes[2] as a Double, returning the intermediate CalcResult.value. With simpleCalculation false, a nonnull stored atkCalculation reaches the calculation-object dispatch helper instead of this simple scalar branch. In the selected unpatched CalculationBase.GetAttribute body, a supplied override array returns its indexed Double after a bounds check; only a null array falls back to source.attributes.GetValue(attributeType).",
    "conditional": "The reviewed normal native patch-table guards must select the default path, all named providers must return normally, and any post-evaluation guard must allow the result copy. The current indirect patch path bypasses these calculations; its provider internals and live selection are not claimed.",
    "unresolved": "The authored action's execution, snapshot branch's semantics, blackboard provider result, override-array construction, live iFix state, calculation-object helper's complete dispatch, later processors, mitigation and final damage are not established."
